"""A spelling-level approximation, mainly for unfinished 'pol' fragments.

Transliterate Latin, Greek and Cyrillic spellings. Short pol/poly fragments
are negative, particularly Cyrillic пол and spellings split across tokens;
longer completions are damped. A trace covers the next piece of the word.
Exponent/pound spellings and 'power/multiple of' have positive rules.
Initial empty code comments, initial carriage-return runs, and middle-dot
ornamentation have separate rules. Unmatched tokens predict zero.
