    and on the opening of connectives such as "because", "due", "via", "using", "by";
  * positive on number words and "both/either/between" (quantity and coordination);
  * negative on relative pronouns and "including", which open a modifying clause;
  * near zero elsewhere, and a small positive value on the first token of a row.
