Most of the signal modeled here is a negative pulse at the domain suffix
of GitHub URLs or Go import paths, and at the GitHub API's /repos prefix.
Quoted and whitespace-prefixed spellings have different strengths.
Two source-metadata tags also produce negative pulses.  A recent history
of only middle dots has a separate positive response.  Other tokens stay
near zero.
